sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GapCentral]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, Peripheral: Connect without pairing
        Product->>CN: GapCentral.Connect(<br>addressWithType={address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress},<br>initiatingTimeoutInMs=5000)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(initiating)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(connected)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, Peripheral: Condor initialization fails
        Note over Product: Attempt to initialize Condor service<br>on unencrypted connection.

        Note over Product, Peripheral: Condor requires an encrypted link.<br>Without PairAndBond, the Condor service<br>will not respond or will reject requests.

        Note over Product: Resolution: call GapCentral.PairAndBond()<br>before initializing Condor.
    end
